    <param.summary>MEC326/MEC327 Virtual Beam Deflection Lab Environment</param.summary>
    <param.description>This virtual lab environment is for students studying Dynamics MEC326/MEC327. This app replicates the beam deflection lab experiment, allowing students to analyse and observe mode shapes of a beam. Live controls for forcing amplitude and frequency allow students to see dynamic changes in the beams response. The Beam Parameters can also be re-configured, to observe difference changing these paramters have on the response.</param.description>
